Changes from upstream:

- server.cjs `brandMarkup`: renders a text attribution only. Upstream loads a logo from
  primeradiant.com with the Superpowers version in the query string unless a telemetry opt-out
  variable is set; this copy makes no request outside the local server.

The bash launchers are replaced by scripts/powershell/start-companion.ps1 and stop-companion.ps1.
When updating from upstream, diff the three files against the new release and reapply the change above.
